{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11412140","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11412140","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1141214001:1":{"text":"Hey, Satrana, reckon you could do some divination for me?","source_cn":"萨忒娜，能不能帮我占卜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD154F46909499256","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1141214002:1":{"text":"Let's see. The sky is clear, and there's a nice airflow. I think we can get a fortune sign.","source_cn":"嗯，天空很澄澈，空气流通性也不错，应该能得出不错的结果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C66D0E9D20A0B42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141214003:1":{"text":"What would you like to know?","source_cn":"你要占卜什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD52EE6A72E99251B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1141214004:1":{"text":"Money. Blew through all my bounty cash. When can I start crawlin' outta this pit?","source_cn":"钱。之前的赏金都花光了，我什么时候能摆脱这种处境？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EB08A696260892A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141214005:1":{"text":"Okay... Oh dear! This bone broke in half! A terrible omen!","source_cn":"我看看——天啊，占卜的兽骨都被烧断了！这是大凶之兆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07631D17D8748803","variant_status":"","ma